              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-KondhaDesert-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Wizard, why does my form surprise you? It is true, there are few of my kind among the Spiral... and even less now.",
                "m_picture": "",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BlackSunPriest_KH2_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-KondhaDesert-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Such is the power of Death. A natural, a vital, part of the Spiral. If things did not die, how could anything new be born?",
                "m_picture": "",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BlackSunPriest_KH2_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-KondhaDesert-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Chamber of the Underworld Sun is a place of power. It is here the Shadow Queen learned about the Lords of Night.",
                "m_picture": "",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BlackSunPriest_KH2_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-KondhaDesert-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And here she learned how the Black Sun Priestesses could bring Malistaire out of the Underworld. And the power of Xibalba.",
                "m_picture": "",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BlackSunPriest_KH2_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-KondhaDesert-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "There is little I can teach you, but take this Death Lens, and use it to advance your knowledge of Sun and Shadow.",
                "m_picture": "",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BlackSunPriest_KH2_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
